full-query: "As a Database Engineer, you need to design a solution to migrate data from an on-premises MySQL database to a Cloud SQL for MySQL instance. The migration process must ensure minimal downtime, fault-tolerance, and allow for data validation before making the Cloud SQL instance live. Which of the following options best meets these requirements?"
