  "tip": "<p>When a question asks for <i>minimal downtime</i> migration to Cloud SQL and the ability to <i>validate</i> the target before a brief <i>cutover</i>, look for <i>continuous replication</i> with Database Migration Service rather than batch exports or custom pipelines.</p>",
